  <XDFTABLE uniqueid="0x1012" flags="0x0">
    <title>Burble duration, in gear [CAUTION] (ip_t_min_pu__n__tco)</title>
    <description>ip_t_min_pu__n__tco | change with care | risk medium&#013;&#010;Stock: 0.22 to 0.47 s&#013;&#010;Allowed by ms45_check.py: 0 to 2.5&#013;&#010;&#013;&#010;How long the ECU keeps injecting after lifting off in gear, over rpm and coolant temperature.&#013;&#010;&#013;&#010;Recipe: Only columns 60 and 90 C. Step 1: 1600 = 0.40, 2400 = 0.70, 3600 = 1.00, 4800 = 1.10, 6500 = 1.10. Step 2 (only after a clean step 1): 0.40 / 0.70 / 1.10 / 1.50 / 2.00. Above 1.2 s the torque monitor hold time runs out.&#013;&#010;&#013;&#010;Emulator: fuel cut after this time if rpm stays above the threshold. The map is read with the current rpm, so the time gets shorter as rpm falls. While torque is not reduced, a floor of 1.21 s applies. Between 30 and 60 C it interpolates, so a change at 60 C already partly applies from 30 C.&#013;&#010;&#013;&#010;Together with: Not used with the clutch pressed (c_t_min_pu applies there). The threshold ip_n_min_puc limits it from below. Sound needs later ignition (ip_iga_min_n_maf_pu).&#013;&#010;&#013;&#010;Test: Warm, private ground, lift off from 2000, 3500, 5500 rpm. Less engine braking for the set time is normal.</description>
    <CATEGORYMEM index="0" category="2" />
    <XDFAXIS id="x" uniqueid="0x0">
      <EMBEDDEDDATA mmedaddress="0x44F4B" mmedelementsizebits="8" mmedmajorstridebits="8" mmedminorstridebits="0" />
      <units>&#176;C</units>
      <indexcount>6</indexcount>
      <decimalpl>2</decimalpl>
      <embedinfo type="1" />
      <datatype>0</datatype>
      <unittype>0</unittype>
      <DALINK index="0" />
      <MATH equation="0.7500000000 * X+ -48.000000">
        <VAR id="X" />
      </MATH>
    </XDFAXIS>
    <XDFAXIS id="y" uniqueid="0x0">
      <EMBEDDEDDATA mmedaddress="0x47C4A" mmedelementsizebits="16" mmedmajorstridebits="16" mmedminorstridebits="0" />
      <units>rpm</units>
      <indexcount>8</indexcount>
      <decimalpl>0</decimalpl>
      <embedinfo type="1" />
      <datatype>0</datatype>
      <unittype>0</unittype>
      <DALINK index="0" />
